Woodgrove Bank must configure a key rotation policy for a key in Vault1. The key must be rotated 18 months after creation, each new version must expire after 2 years, and a notification must be raised 30 days before expiry.

How should you complete the policy? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.

```json
{
  "lifetimeActions": [
    { "trigger": { "timeAfterCreate": "[[1]]" }, "action": { "type": "[[2]]" } },
    { "trigger": { "timeBeforeExpiry": "P30D" }, "action": { "type": "[[3]]" } }
  ],
  "attributes": { "expiryTime": "[[4]]" }
}
```
